\fs24 npm install <packageName> \'97> package installing. ** just npm install command can be used for dependency installation\
\
npm install <packageName>  \'97save \'97> install and save as Dependencies \
\
npm install <packageName>  \'97save-dev \'97> install and save as devDependencies \
\
npm uninstall <packageName> \'97> uninstall the package can be used as  \'97save or \'97save-dev \
\
npm update <packageName> \'97> updates package or all packages without package name on dependencies.\
\
npm outdated \'97> checks the dependencies as older or newer.\
\
npm init \'97> starts new project and create package.json\
\
npm search <packageName> \'97> search for package on project\
\
npm list : shows all the dependencies as list\
\
npm start : starts the project according to package.json scripts. CAUTION : \'93start\'94 keyword is needed.\
\
npm test : tests the project according to package.json scripts\
\
npm run <keywords> :   according to keyword, activates the script\
\
